WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.100
A square number is the area of a square.

2
00:00:03.902 --> 00:00:07.777
Side four: four rows of four. Four squared is sixteen.

3
00:00:08.479 --> 00:00:11.904
Side five: five times five is twenty-five.

4
00:00:15.845 --> 00:00:18.970
The square root goes back: the side is five.
